    "setBonus": "2 of Set: When you use an encounter or daily power during combat, you gain a stack of Scalebreaker's Ire for 20 seconds. Each stack of Scalebreaker's Ire grants you additional Boosts bonuses depending on your role.\nDPS: +1% Recharge Speed and Action Point Gain\nTank: +1% Stamina Regeneration and Action Point Gain\nHealer: +1% Movement Speed and Action Point Gain\n\nOnce you reach 6 stacks of Scalebreaker's Ire, they are consumed and you are empowered with Scalebreaker's Wrath for 30 seconds, granting the following, depending on your role:\nDPS: +7.5% Base Damage Boost\nTank: -7.5% Incoming Damage\nHealer: +7.5% Overall Outgoing Healing\n\nYou may only have 1 stack of Scalebreaker's Wrath at a time and the duration is refreshed each time you reach 6 stacks of Scalebreaker's Ire.",
